# Generated: the zetl vault index is rebuilt by `zetl check`/`zetl build`.
# UNANCHORED on purpose. `/.zetl` matched only a vault at the repo root, and this
# repo's vault is `specs/`, so `specs/.zetl/index.json` — 19k generated lines —
# stayed untracked and was swept into a commit by a `git add -A`. A generated
# index is generated wherever its vault is.
